# --- bht-sjednica-final-review: keep the work product, not the source material ---
# The repo was deliberately reduced from ~100 MB to ~3.6 MB (see CLAUDE.md).
# These are third-party or regenerable inputs held locally; they are NOT committed.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no trailing-comment syntax - a comment after a pattern on the
# same line becomes part of the pattern and silently matches nothing.

# 232 MB certified site project (client archive)
bht-sjednica-final-review/SITE-PROJECT-SJEDNICA-Bileca-K2-S38-m/
# 41 MB vendor manuals (Huawei, FG Wilson) - the one datasheet we rely on is in reference/
bht-sjednica-final-review/EQUIPEMENT/
# 80 MB pre-change snapshot, mostly the un-optimised 79.5 MB Prilog III
bht-sjednica-final-review/TD-OUTPUT-BASELINE-20260807/
# 16 MB export bundle of this repo, made for sending the package out by mail;
# it is the repo packed into itself and would grow with every re-export
bht-sjednica-final-review/sjednica-hybrid-solar.zip
# LibreOffice lock files left behind while a document is open
.~lock.*#
# render previews and scratch CAD
bht-sjednica-final-review/cad/_*.png
bht-sjednica-final-review/cad/_frame_test.dxf
# 9 MB combined, different site (Mlinište, not Sjednica) EPLAN electrical-schematic
# DWGs pulled in as a drafting reference on 2026-08-08; not cleanly separable from
# their genset/container content (see KONTEJNER.oxps for the useful part instead)
bht-sjednica-final-review/reference/P13_5_FG_Wilson_hybrid MLINISTE.dwg
bht-sjednica-final-review/reference/P13_5_FG_Wilson_hybrid MLINISTE_2.dwg

# --- pvsim: PVGIS responses are cached locally; only the small reference
# responses under pvsim/sites/<id>/pvgis_ref/ (with their sha256 manifest) are
# committed. Run outputs are copied into each site's review/pvsim/ by `report`.
pvsim/cache/
pvsim/out/

# --- hamzici-hybrid-solar: ~850 MB of client inputs held locally, not committed
# (same policy as the Sjednica site project above). The work product next to
# them - cad/, review/, tools/ - is committed.
# two versions of the certified 2017 site project (space- and underscore-named)
hamzici-hybrid-solar/GP BS*/
# vendor manuals and datasheets
hamzici-hybrid-solar/EQUIPEMENT/
# 08.09.2026 site photos, full resolution; this folder also holds two unrelated
# items (mliniste-full.mp4, Icao9303/) that belong to other work
hamzici-hybrid-solar/hamzici-photos/

# --- rfp-hybrid-solar-td/report: the build script is committed; the report template,
# the measured NetEco data of other BH Telecom sites and the built page stay local
# (this repo is public)
rfp-hybrid-solar-td/report/local/
